patch.description:
Change a client-side member's role/status. Nobody changes their own membership; the last
active company_owner cannot be demoted or deactivated by a company-side caller's mistake;
reactivation counts against limit.users (a user is counted once across memberships).

post.description:
Provision an organization for a customer: organization + trial subscription + a pending
firm-owner invitation, atomically. The owner sets their own password and enrolls MFA on first sign-in;
nobody at Artify ever knows or sets a customer password.
